OL,3,GNEWSATalent search launched to find new
OL,4,AOlympic divers
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreat Britain's Olympic Diving team has
OL,7,Fput the call out to emerging athletes
OL,8,Fto take up the sport to increase the
OL,9,Fchances of future Olympic success.
OL,11,FAquatics GB has launched a talent
OL,12,Fsearch for the next generation of
OL,13,Fdivers to compete in the 2032 Brisbane
OL,14,FOlympics, with training expected to
OL,15,Ftake place at Sheffield's Ponds Forge.
OL,17,FThere, new divers will be integrated
OL,18,Finto a performance centre which
OL,19,Fcurrently hosts five of Team GB's Paris
OL,20,FOlympians, including bronze medallists
OL,21,FYasmin Harper and Anthony Harding.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
