OL,3,GNEWSATalent search launched to find new
OL,4,AOlympic divers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Diving-Gymnastics Talent Transfer
OL,7,FProgramme hopes to transfer talented
OL,8,F12-16 year olds in acrobatic sports
OL,9,Fsuch as gymnastics, cheerleading or
OL,10,Feven freestyle skiing to platform
OL,11,Fdiving.
